1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 22=

8
00:00:59,079 --> 00:01:01,619
How dare you disrupt the balance
of yin and yang

9
00:01:02,159 --> 00:01:03,460
and defy reincarnation!

10
00:01:03,859 --> 00:01:05,659
This woman's lifespan is up.

11
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:07,640
Her soul belongs to the Underworld.

12
00:01:08,219 --> 00:01:09,640
It's the unbending law of the Dao.

13
00:01:10,099 --> 00:01:12,099
You shall die!

14
00:01:17,700 --> 00:01:21,780
My wife is not bound
by any iron law of the Dao!

15
00:01:22,379 --> 00:01:24,879
Today, I will bring her back.

16
00:01:25,879 --> 00:01:26,879
King of the Underworld,

17
00:01:27,700 --> 00:01:28,900
if you have any sense,

18
00:01:29,719 --> 00:01:31,019
withdraw now.

19
00:01:31,359 --> 00:01:32,359
Arrogant fool!

20
00:01:32,780 --> 00:01:34,200
A mere True Immortal

21
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:37,299
dares speak so insolently before me?

22
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,400
Stubborn fool!

23
00:01:38,900 --> 00:01:40,599
Then your soul

24
00:01:40,599 --> 00:01:43,000
will be cast into the Eternal Abyss
as well!

25
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,280
Laws of the Underworld,

26
00:01:46,719 --> 00:01:48,019
10,000 souls devour the heart!

27
00:02:06,799 --> 00:02:09,960
Is... Is Dong battling
the King of the Underworld?

28
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,280
This is terrifying.

29
00:02:34,039 --> 00:02:36,360
Dong is defying a god

30
00:02:36,599 --> 00:02:38,000
for Cuicui's sake.

31
00:02:39,039 --> 00:02:42,300
Fair enough.
Dong even dares to defy the heavens,

32
00:02:42,439 --> 00:02:43,639
let alone a god.

33
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:09,199
I am the Dao Ancestor.

34
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:10,879
What you say comes true.

35
00:03:11,860 --> 00:03:14,879
I dictate the life and death here,

36
00:03:15,639 --> 00:03:18,699
and reincarnation bends to my will.

37
00:03:19,340 --> 00:03:20,340
Disperse!

38
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:26,240
Might of a Dao Ancestor?

39
00:03:26,479 --> 00:03:27,680
It's might of a Dao Ancestor!

40
00:03:28,219 --> 00:03:29,219
Impossible!

41
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:31,240
How could a Dao Ancestor
exist in this world?

42
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,939
Who are you?

43
00:03:34,180 --> 00:03:36,020
You are not worthy to know my identity.

44
00:03:37,599 --> 00:03:38,800
I only ask you this.

45
00:03:39,699 --> 00:03:42,159
Will you withdraw, or not?

46
00:03:45,199 --> 00:03:46,759
Even if you are a Dao Ancestor,

47
00:03:47,180 --> 00:03:49,740
order must be kept
between life and death.

48
00:03:50,219 --> 00:03:51,780
Keeping the dead here

49
00:03:52,259 --> 00:03:54,099
will invite the backlash of Dao.

50
00:03:54,659 --> 00:03:56,800
I wield the law of the Underworld.

51
00:03:57,259 --> 00:03:59,360
I will not let you transgress!

52
00:04:04,060 --> 00:04:05,300
Body of the Underworld god!

53
00:04:05,599 --> 00:04:07,080
Spear of judgment!

54
00:04:14,939 --> 00:04:18,079
Extinction of the Dao!

55
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:31,519
This... This power transcends
the laws of the universe.

56
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:32,800
You...

57
00:04:36,980 --> 00:04:38,540
I was blind

58
00:04:39,100 --> 00:04:40,560
to offend the Dao Ancestor.

59
00:04:41,639 --> 00:04:42,759
I beg

60
00:04:43,540 --> 00:04:44,540
for mercy.

61
00:04:46,459 --> 00:04:49,259
I am taking Cuicui's soul.

62
00:04:50,019 --> 00:04:52,620
I will rewrite her lifespan.

63
00:04:53,660 --> 00:04:55,839
Do you have any objections?

64
00:04:56,319 --> 00:04:57,339
I dare not.

65
00:04:58,519 --> 00:05:01,319
I shall obey your decree.

66
00:05:02,500 --> 00:05:03,500
Get lost!

67
00:05:11,899 --> 00:05:14,839
Is... Is it over?

68
00:05:15,339 --> 00:05:17,120
That terrifying entity...

69
00:05:19,100 --> 00:05:20,100
He's gone?

70
00:05:20,939 --> 00:05:22,279
Did Dong win?

71
00:05:22,399 --> 00:05:23,620
I was so worried.

72
00:05:36,259 --> 00:05:37,399
- Cuicui!
- Cuicui!

73
00:05:48,959 --> 00:05:51,259
Dong, you really saved Cuicui!

74
00:05:51,439 --> 00:05:52,439
That's wonderful!

75
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:56,839
While I was asleep,

76
00:05:57,279 --> 00:05:59,660
I saw everything you did for me.

77
00:06:00,079 --> 00:06:02,759
In the end, you even wrested me
from the King of the Underworld.

78
00:06:05,699 --> 00:06:08,220
Thank you, Dong.

79
00:06:09,980 --> 00:06:12,600
I promised to protect you all
for the rest of my life.

80
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,040
I'll never break my word.

81
00:06:14,137 --> 00:06:17,215
(Affection: 100)

82
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:29,560
Ancestor,

83
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:33,279
the True Immortal is a direct disciple
of the Supreme Destined Divine Maiden.

84
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:34,800
Zixia Sect has truly secured

85
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:37,439
an unprecedented,
almighty patron this time!

86
00:06:37,439 --> 00:06:38,439
That's for sure.

87
00:06:39,459 --> 00:06:42,040
This is the culmination
of 10,000 years of our sect's fortune.

88
00:06:42,399 --> 00:06:43,560
Once he is pleased,

89
00:06:43,699 --> 00:06:46,100
our ascension to the upper realm
will be at hand.

90
00:06:46,759 --> 00:06:50,199
But regarding the Holy Maiden,
are you certain nothing will go wrong?

91
00:06:50,379 --> 00:06:51,379
Rest assured, Ancestor.

92
00:06:51,759 --> 00:06:53,819
The Mind-Control Art
has pierced deep into her soul.

93
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:56,579
Now, my dear daughter
has nothing in her heart and mind

94
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:59,839
but adoration and obedience
toward Lord True Immortal.

95
00:07:00,220 --> 00:07:01,279
Her loyalty is absolute.

96
00:07:03,879 --> 00:07:05,579
The auspicious hour has arrived!

97
00:07:06,759 --> 00:07:08,379
The newlyweds shall pay respects!

98
00:07:08,819 --> 00:07:11,699
Bow to the Supreme Destined Divinity!

99
00:07:18,379 --> 00:07:20,540
To have my master,
the Destined Divine Maiden,

100
00:07:20,540 --> 00:07:22,100
bear witness with her divine will

101
00:07:22,319 --> 00:07:24,160
is an honor you lower-realm cultivators

102
00:07:24,199 --> 00:07:26,040
could hardly earn in 100 lifetimes.

103
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:32,980
Zhang Daozhen, earning my favor

104
00:07:33,300 --> 00:07:35,779
is a blessing you gathered
over ten lifetimes of reincarnation.

105
00:07:36,519 --> 00:07:39,439
My lord, I thank you for your favor.

106
00:07:40,139 --> 00:07:42,800
I will serve you for all eternity.

107
00:07:45,079 --> 00:07:46,360
I do not consent

108
00:07:46,879 --> 00:07:48,579
to this marriage!

109
00:08:11,554 --> 00:08:15,145
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

110
00:08:15,145 --> 00:08:17,932
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

111
00:08:18,508 --> 00:08:20,670
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

112
00:08:20,670 --> 00:08:23,516
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

113
00:08:23,516 --> 00:08:26,794
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

114
00:08:26,794 --> 00:08:28,428
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

115
00:08:28,428 --> 00:08:30,492
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

116
00:08:30,492 --> 00:08:32,028
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

117
00:08:32,028 --> 00:08:34,810
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

118
00:08:35,259 --> 00:08:37,164
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

119
00:08:37,164 --> 00:08:43,195
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

120
00:08:43,777 --> 00:08:47,660
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

121
00:08:47,660 --> 00:08:50,885
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

122
00:08:51,397 --> 00:08:53,996
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

123
00:08:53,996 --> 00:08:59,124
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

124
00:08:59,124 --> 00:09:02,652
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

125
00:09:02,652 --> 00:09:06,360
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

126
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:08,252
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

127
00:09:08,252 --> 00:09:10,329
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

128
00:09:10,329 --> 00:09:12,860
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

129
00:09:12,860 --> 00:09:16,897
♪You met the most precious person♪

130
00:09:18,565 --> 00:09:20,428
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

131
00:09:20,428 --> 00:09:22,947
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

132
00:09:22,947 --> 00:09:24,396
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

133
00:09:24,396 --> 00:09:26,698
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

134
00:09:26,698 --> 00:09:28,668
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

135
00:09:28,668 --> 00:09:33,078
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

136
00:09:33,078 --> 00:09:34,620
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

137
00:09:34,620 --> 00:09:36,530
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

138
00:09:36,530 --> 00:09:39,804
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

139
00:09:39,804 --> 00:09:43,125
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

140
00:09:43,125 --> 00:09:44,860
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

141
00:09:44,860 --> 00:09:49,484
♪Just catch your breath first♪

142
00:09:49,484 --> 00:09:53,234
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

143
00:09:53,234 --> 00:09:56,612
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

144
00:09:56,986 --> 00:09:58,956
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

145
00:09:58,956 --> 00:10:04,703
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

146
00:10:04,703 --> 00:10:08,219
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

147
00:10:08,219 --> 00:10:09,788
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

148
00:10:09,788 --> 00:10:12,098
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

149
00:10:12,098 --> 00:10:13,836
♪From laughter to devotion♪

150
00:10:13,836 --> 00:10:15,892
♪From falling to innocence♪

151
00:10:15,892 --> 00:10:17,740
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

152
00:10:17,740 --> 00:10:24,410
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
